  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NTGD124.AiAgentBehaviour
  _componentDescription: The agent that carries out the player's sentence. It walks
    the parsed steps in order, does exactly what it was told when the step is clear,
    and guesses when it is not. Guesses ask the language model for advice first,
    then go through the 50/50 and the 0 to 100 randomisers. Every single step is
    written to the console so the sequencing can be checked while testing.
  AgentStatusLabel: {fileID: 1083979431}
  StepMessageLabel: {fileID: 139641551}
  ReasoningPanelObject: {fileID: 1943504697}
