  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NTGD124.WordSelectionManager
  _componentDescription: 'Fills one shared panel with every clickable word container.
    The three numbered buttons on the right of that panel switch which page is showing:
    1 is action words, 2 is tools, 3 is ingredients. Clicking a word greys it out
    and copies it into the output panel, building the clunky sentence the player
    sends to the agent.'
